    {
      "text": "gospel of the kingdom shall be preached, Matt. 24:14 (JS—M 1:31). Wheresoever this gospel shall be preached, Matt. 26:13 (Mark 14:9). The beginning of the gospel of Jesus Christ, Mark 1:1. Jesus came into Galilee, preaching the gospel, Mark 1:14. gospel must first be published among all nations, Mark 13:10. preach the gospel to every creature, Mark 16:15. I bring you good tidings of great joy, Luke 2:10. anointed me to preach the gospel to the poor, Luke 4:18. went through the towns, preaching the gospel, Luke 9:6. preached the gospel in many villages, Acts 8:25. Gentiles … should hear the word of the gospel, Acts 15:7. to testify the gospel of the grace of God, Acts 20:24. I am not ashamed of the gospel of Christ, Rom. 1:16. God shall judge … according to my gospel, Rom. 2:16. preach the gospel of peace, Rom. 10:15. I have fully preached the gospel, Rom. 15:19. not to baptize, but to preach the gospel, 1 Cor. 1:17. I have begotten you through the gospel, 1 Cor. 4:15. they which preach the gospel should live of the gospel, 1 Cor. 9:14. though I preach the gospel, I have nothing to glory of, 1 Cor. 9:16. I declare unto you the gospel, 1 Cor. 15:1. gospel … hid to them that are lost, 2 Cor. 4:3. if ye receive another spirit … or another gospel, 2 Cor. 11:4. some that … would pervert the gospel, Gal. 1:7. though we … preach any other gospel unto you than … we have preached, Gal. 1:8. gospel which was preached of me is not after man, Gal. 1:11. gospel of the uncircumcision, Gal. 2:7. preached before the gospel unto Abraham, Gal. 3:8. word of truth, the gospel of your salvation, Eph. 1:13. shod with the preparation of the gospel of peace, Eph. 6:15. make known the mystery of the gospel, Eph. 6:19. in the defence and confirmation of the gospel, ye all are partakers of my grace, Philip. 1:7. hope … heard before in the word of the truth of the gospel, Col. 1:5. gospel came not unto you in word only, 1 Thes. 1:5. put in trust with the gospel, 1 Thes. 2:4. that obey not the gospel of our Lord, 2 Thes. 1:8. called you by our gospel, to the obtaining of the glory, 2 Thes. 2:14. immortality to light through the gospel, 2 Tim. 1:10. Jesus … raised from the dead according to my gospel, 2 Tim. 2:8. unto us was the gospel preached, as well as unto them, Heb. 4:2. gospel preached also to them that are dead, 1 Pet. 4:6. angel … having the everlasting gospel to preach, Rev. 14:6.",
