      "text": "Gentiles had received the fulness of the Gospel, 1 Ne. 10:14. most plain and precious parts of the gospel … kept back by that abominable church, 1 Ne. 13:34. fulness of the gospel of the Messiah, 1 Ne. 15:13. these are they … who have brought good tidings, Mosiah 15:14. this is the gospel which I have given unto you, 3 Ne. 27:13 (D&C 76:40). I say unto you, this is my gospel, 3 Ne. 27:21 (D&C 33:12; 39:6). did preach the gospel of Christ unto all people, 3 Ne. 28:23. they who rejected the gospel were called Lamanites, 4 Ne. 1:38. lay hold upon the gospel of Christ, Morm. 7:8. denieth these things knoweth not the gospel of Christ, Morm. 9:8. believe in my gospel, and be baptized, Ether 4:18.",
